                <p>India's most trusted premium furniture brand, crafting beautiful spaces for over 15 years. Every
                    piece tells a story of quality, craftsmanship and timeless design.</p>
                <div class="social-links">
                    <a href="#" class="social-link"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
                    <a href="#" class="social-link"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
                    <a href="#" class="social-link"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
                    <a href="#" class="social-link"><i class="fab fa-youtube"></i></a>
                    <a href="#" class="social-link"><i class="fab fa-pinterest"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Quick Links</h4>
                <ul class="footer-links">
                    <li><a href="index.html"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> Home</a></li>
                    <li><a href="products"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> All Products</a></li>
                    <li><a href="about"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> About Us</a></li>
                    <li><a href="contact.html"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> Contact</a></li>
                    <li><a href="offers.html"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> Special Offers</a></li>
                    <li><a href="faq.html"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> FAQ</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Categories</h4>
                <ul class="footer-links">
                    <li><a href="products?cat=sofas"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> Sofas &amp; Sectionals</a>
                    </li>
                    <li><a href="products?cat=beds"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> Beds &amp; Bedroom</a></li>
                    <li><a href="products?cat=dining"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> Dining Tables</a></li>
                    <li><a href="products?cat=chairs"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> Chairs</a></li>
                    <li><a href="products?cat=wardrobes"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> Wardrobes</a></li>
                    <li><a href="products?cat=cabinets"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> Cabinets</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col footer-contact">
                <h4>Contact Us</h4>
                <p><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> 42, Design District, Connaught Place, New Delhi – 110001</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-phone"></i> +91 98765 43210</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> info@luxecasa.com</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> Mon–Sat: 10 AM – 8 PM</p>
                <p><i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> WhatsApp: +91 98765 43210</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <p>© 2025 <span>LuxeCasa Furniture</span>. All rights reserved. Designed with ❤️ in India.</p>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:20px">
                <a href="privacy.html" style="color:rgba(245,240,232,0.3);font-size:0.8rem;text-decoration:none">Privacy
                    Policy</a>
                <a href="terms.html" style="color:rgba(245,240,232,0.3);font-size:0.8rem;text-decoration:none">Terms of
                    Service</a>
                <a href="refund.html" style="color:rgba(245,240,232,0.3);font-size:0.8rem;text-decoration:none">Refund
                    Policy</a>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-payment">
                <span class="payment-icon">VISA</span>
                <span class="payment-icon">MASTERCARD</span>
                <span class="payment-icon">UPI</span>
                <span class="payment-icon">RAZORPAY</span>
